{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A lonely journey through the darkness of night... But are you truly alone?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Limb Driver</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limb Driver</strong>, a first-person psychological horror game, pulls the player into a mysterious and unsettling world. Abandoned roads, forgotten memories, and a terror lurking in the shadows... As the line between reality and illusion begins to blur, will you be able to make the right choices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/limbdr.gif?t=1744649979\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combining exploration, survival, and narrative-driven horror, <strong>Limb Driver</strong> offers players mechanics such as driving, puzzle-solving, and environmental interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/limbdr_4.gif?t=1744649979\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense atmosphere and photorealistic graphics</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS and retro film aesthetic</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story shaped by NPC dialogue and environmental clues</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices matter \u2014 events unfold based on your decisions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you make it to the end of the road?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630640?t=1744649979","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630640?t=1744649979","capsule